module ShowcaseDemo where

using std (Image, imageFromPackedRgba)

-- Pictures of the people and the project logos of the people-and-projects
-- demo, as ordinary Image data. The owner supplied the photos and logos for
-- this public demo on 2026-11-11; the original bytes live in
-- distros/narthex/solid/public/demo/people/ (rom.png, 95 x 95, kept at its own
-- size, corners completed on 2026-11-12, the inside of the round crop unchanged;
-- bayne.png, 400 x 400, reduced to 96 x 96; aajonus.png, 333 x 400, its
-- top 333 x 333 square from 10 px down, reduced to 64 x 64) and
-- distros/narthex/solid/public/demo/projects/ (each logo centred on a
-- transparent square as wide as its longer side, reduced to 64 x 64).
-- Encoded with the food pictures' encoder:
--   ./workstreams/recipe-functions/tools/picture-to-fenel.ps1 -Picture <png> -Size <side>
-- one decimal RGBA word per pixel, read by std.imageFromPackedRgba.
-- A person's picture is a field of the person; a logo's picture is attached
-- to its Logo constructor by a Picturable instance, as the food pictures are.

@label "Rom's picture"
